{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284350","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284350","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028435001:0":{"text":"聞こえましたか？木という木から、グリームテールが発する小さな音が聞こえてきます。","source_cn":"你们听到没有？树上全是荧尾鼠发出的细碎声音。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8114BC3CB6A1C509","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028435002:0":{"text":"あのジェイドレイク学園の先生は、グリームテールのオスとメスが一匹ずつ必要だって言ってましたが……どうやったら捕まえられるんでしょう？音は聞こえますが、近くに一匹も見当たりません。","source_cn":"那个翡湖学院的老师说，需要荧尾鼠公母各一只……不过要怎...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A189EA0C0E8EA73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028435003:1":{"text":"ええ、あいつらは臆病だから、人がいるところには絶対出てこないんですよ。","source_cn":"啊，那些家伙胆子小，有人在绝对不敢出来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x949BA7F29D38D695","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028435004:0":{"text":"グリームテールの好物を覚えていれば、食べ物でおびき寄せられるんですが……","source_cn":"记得它们喜欢吃什么东西来着，可以用食物把它们引诱出来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4A1F3A07D26C576","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028435005:0":{"text":"そうだ、<style=\"highlight\">ビーンズバイン</style>です！この辺にあるはずです。","source_cn":"对了，<style=highlight>紫豆藤</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377089E31BC999EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_r